:[{"name":"骑士标枪","description":"命中目标时，一定概率正义之矛从天而降，按照每秒伤害的40%造成额外伤害。"}],"skill":{"name":"矛刺","description":"投掷正义之矛，对敌人造成强劲伤害，并附带击飞效果。","levels":[4,7],"damage":[320.0,365.0],"cooldown":[7.0,7.0],"ailment":"击飞"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[29],"Height":[171],"Weight":[54]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"伊娃，坎特伯雷王国骑士团“守护者”第19任骑士团长。\n\n幼年体质羸弱，却有出色的魔法才赋，本应成为天生魔法师…尽管所有人都担心忧虑，但她还是刻苦锻炼，成功加入了“守护者”，而且凭借突出的领导能力与非凡的骑士道精神晋升为骑士团长。伊娃成为骑士团长之后，新兵入团及资深守护者晋升条件变得更加苛刻。伊娃打破了超过一定骑士团年限，自然而然成为资深守护者的旧传统。伊娃希望“守护者”团员都能像自己一样，是通过严格选拔并具备超强实力的人才。这样，才能完成守护坎特伯雷的光荣使命。\n\n对王国的忠诚让伊娃赢得了包括卡米拉女王在内的王室成员们的极大信任，也让她成为整个国家和王室的可靠的亲密伙伴。","storyKey":"profile_knight_captain_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=5","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=5","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"knight_captain","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["我们没空休息，继续前进！"],"enUS":["There's no time to rest. Move!"],"jaJP":["休んでいる暇はない、進め！"]},"keys":["cv_knight_captain_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"50001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["为了坎特伯雷！"],"enUS":["Glory to Kanterbury!"],"jaJP":["勝利の栄光を、カンタベリーに！"]},"keys":["cv_knight_captain_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/5/50002@613001415983481726"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"50002"},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["剩下的…就交给你了。"],"enUS":["I'll leave the rest… To you…"],"jaJP":["後を… 頼む…"]},"keys":["cv_knight_captain_Die"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/5/50003@-975549381772692659"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/5/50003"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/vo